WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.017
How many orders came in on WhatsApp today?

2
00:00:03.017 --> 00:00:06.382
And how many did someone sit and retype, line by line?

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.529
A voice note.

4
00:00:07.529 --> 00:00:09.443
A photo of a handwritten list.

5
00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:10.592
"The usual cable."

6
00:00:10.592 --> 00:00:11.868
"Same as last time."

7
00:00:11.868 --> 00:00:16.397
Your rep translates, searches the catalog, checks the price, and types.

8
00:00:16.397 --> 00:00:18.248
And when they're on vacation?

9
00:00:18.248 --> 00:00:19.396
Everything stalls.

10
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:20.433
Meet Tazmin.

11
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:24.984
The order assistant for equipment distributors, working right inside WhatsApp.

12
00:00:25.333 --> 00:00:27.337
Customers keep writing like always.

13
00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:32.204
Your rep forwards the message to Tazmin, and within a minute gets back a clean quote.

14
00:00:32.204 --> 00:00:38.159
It identifies the customer, pulls their history and price list, and matches every line to the exact SKU.

15
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.730
Something unclear?

16
00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:41.166
Tazmin doesn't guess.

17
00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:44.241
It offers three options, and the rep decides.

18
00:00:44.241 --> 00:00:44.993
And prices?

19
00:00:44.993 --> 00:00:46.770
Only from your price list.

20
00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.479
No price is ever made up.

21
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.062
The rep approves with one tap, the customer gets a clean quote, and the order lands in the system you already use.

22
00:00:55.062 --> 00:00:58.413
And with every order, Tazmin learns each customer's language.

23
00:00:58.733 --> 00:00:59.683
Less typing.

24
00:00:59.683 --> 00:01:00.711
Fewer errors.

25
00:01:00.711 --> 00:01:01.898
Faster replies.

26
00:01:01.898 --> 00:01:04.271
And your rep stays in control.

27
00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:06.791
Want to see it on your own data?

28
00:01:06.791 --> 00:01:09.188
Send us real orders from this week.

29
00:01:09.188 --> 00:01:09.667
Tazmin.

30
00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:10.763
Orders in order.

31
00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:11.653
Reps at ease.
